Description: Despite decades of pupillometry research, many established packages 
    and workflows to date unfortunately lack design patterns based on 
    (F)indability (A)ccessbility (I)nteroperability (R)eusability (FAIR) 
    principles. 'eyeris', on the other hand, follows a design philosophy that 
    provides users with an intuitive, modular, performant, and extensible 
    pupillometry data preprocessing framework out-of-the-box. 'eyeris' introduces a 
    (B)rain (I)maging (D)ata (S)tructure (BIDS)-like organization for derivative 
    (i.e., preprocessed) pupillometry data as well as an intuitive workflow for 
    inspecting preprocessed pupil epochs using interactive output report files.
